<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down at 2.7860 vs dlr.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down at 2.7860 vs dlr.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.7860 against the dollar, down from 2.7820 yesterday and at 1.8415 per mark, up from 1.8420, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
